# Your Name

Two or three sentences on your background: years of experience, the kind of
systems you build, and the roles you want the scorer to treat as a match.

## Experience

### Most recent company
What you built, the stack, and the scope. Include the technologies a job
posting would name (languages, kernels, protocols, platforms).

### Earlier company
Same idea. Concrete work beats a list of buzzwords.

## Skills

Languages, systems, and domains you want matched against job postings.
